title: Where are we? A status brief
model: sonnet
effort: low
system: Read-only session: report, change nothing.

Tell me where this repository stands, briefly: open pull requests and their checks; branches and worktrees with unmerged or uncommitted work; what `claude-peer slots` and `claude-peer log show` say is in flight; and anything waiting on me, such as questions left open in recent plans or reports. End with the three things most worth doing next.
